{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-1","timestamp_unix_ms":1747371904599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" Yes, he had no engagement at all for to-morrow; and her invitation was accepted with alacrity.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-2","timestamp_unix_ms":1747371964599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"I would not trust you so near it as Eastbourne, for fifty pounds!","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-3","timestamp_unix_ms":1747372024599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Bingley and Jane, however, soon allowed the others to outstrip them.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-4","timestamp_unix_ms":1747372084599,"direction":"outgoing","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"😊","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-5","timestamp_unix_ms":1747372144599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"What a contrast did it offer to his last address in Rosings Park, when he put his letter into her hand! Her home and her housekeeping, her parish and her poultry, and all their dependent concerns, had not yet lost their charms.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-6","timestamp_unix_ms":1747372204599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Do not imagine, Miss Bennet, that your ambition will ever be gratified.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-7","timestamp_unix_ms":1747372264599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"They entered it in one of its lowest points, and drove for some time through a beautiful wood stretching over a wide extent.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-8","timestamp_unix_ms":1747372324599,"direction":"outgoing","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"What pin-money, what jewels, what carriages you will have!","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-9","timestamp_unix_ms":1747372384599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"But in what proportions it should be divided amongst the latter depended on the will of the parents. As to his real character, had information been in her power, she had never felt a wish of inquiring.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-10","timestamp_unix_ms":1747372444599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"And what sort of young lady is she? To be sure you know no actual good of me--but nobody thinks of _that_ when they fall in love.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-11","timestamp_unix_ms":1747372504599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Jane instantly gave a look at Elizabeth which spoke her distress at such premeditation, and her entreaty that _she_ would not give in to it. How much sooner one tires of anything than of a book!","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-12","timestamp_unix_ms":1747372564599,"direction":"outgoing","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" And so saying, he turned back with them, and walked towards the house.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-13","timestamp_unix_ms":1747372624599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"My mind was more agreeably engaged.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-14","timestamp_unix_ms":1747372684599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"It was unpardonable.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-15","timestamp_unix_ms":1747372744599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Miss Darcy looked as if she wished for courage enough to join in it; and sometimes did venture a short sentence, when there was least danger of its being heard.  \"Dawson\" \"Oh, your father, of course, may spare you, if your mother can.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-16","timestamp_unix_ms":1747372804599,"direction":"outgoing","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" \"Nor I, I am sure,\" said Miss Bingley.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-17","timestamp_unix_ms":1747372864599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"He left Netherfield for London on the day following, as you, I am certain, remember, with the design of soon returning.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-18","timestamp_unix_ms":1747372924599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"I wish you had been there, my dear, to have given him one of your set-downs.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-19","timestamp_unix_ms":1747372984599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"I know you will do him such ample justice, that I am growing every moment more unconcerned and indifferent. We _will_ know where we have gone--we _will_ recollect what we have seen.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-20","timestamp_unix_ms":1747373044599,"direction":"outgoing","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Collins, gratefully accepted, and immediately ordered.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-21","timestamp_unix_ms":1747373104599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"When she came to that part of the letter in which her family were mentioned, in tones of such mortifying, yet merited, reproach, her sense of shame was severe.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-22","timestamp_unix_ms":1747373164599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" the earliest assurance of it; and, after making his bow as the carriage turned into the park, hurried home with the great intelligence.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-23","timestamp_unix_ms":1747373224599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"That is all very proper and civil, I am sure,\" said Mrs.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
