{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-45","timestamp_unix_ms":1747374544599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" After many pauses and many trials of other subjects, Elizabeth could not help reverting once more to the first, and saying,-- \"I am astonished at his intimacy with Mr.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-46","timestamp_unix_ms":1747374604599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Miss Bingley is to live with her brother, and keep his house; and I am much mistaken if we shall not find a very charming neighbour in her.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"sbr-extra-+18189111910-47","timestamp_unix_ms":1747374664599,"direction":"incoming","service":"sms","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+18189111910","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"It was hardly enough; but it pleased her. I am excessively attentive to all those things.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
